    ns1:claimKind "descriptive" ;
    ns1:claimStatement "The higher the norm index, the more it focuses on large values and neglects small ones, making RMSE more sensitive to outliers than MAE." ;
    ns1:description "Higher norm indices focus more on large values and neglect small ones, making RMSE more sensitive to outliers than MAE." ;
    ns1:displayName "Norm Index and Outlier Sensitivity" ;
