    ns1:claimKind "procedure_advice" ;
    ns1:claimStatement "The output layer of the original model should usually be replaced since it is most likely not useful at all for the new task, and it may not even have the right number of outputs." ;
    ns1:description "The output layer of the original model should usually be replaced because it is likely not useful for the new task and may have the wrong number of outputs." ;
